{"page":480,"verses":[{"verse_key":"41:30","surah":41,"ayah":30,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ قَالُوا۟ رَبُّنَا ٱللَّهُ ثُمَّ ٱسْتَقَـٰمُوا۟ تَتَنَزَّلُ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ أَلَّا تَخَافُوا۟ وَلَا تَحْزَنُوا۟ وَأَبْشِرُوا۟ بِٱلْجَنَّةِ ٱلَّتِى كُنتُمْ تُوعَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for those who say, ‘Our Lord is God,’ and take the straight path towards Him, the angels come down to them and say, ‘Have no fear or grief, but rejoice in the good news of Paradise, which you have been promised.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبُّنَا","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbunā","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱسْتَقَـٰمُوا۟","en_gloss":"stand firm ","transliteration":"is'taqāmū","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَتَنَزَّلُ","en_gloss":"will descend","transliteration":"tatanazzalu","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"on them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَخَافُوا۟","en_gloss":"fear","transliteration":"takhāfū","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تَحْزَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"grieve","transliteration":"taḥzanū","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَأَبْشِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"but receive the glad tidings","transliteration":"wa-abshirū","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بِٱلْجَنَّةِ","en_gloss":"of Paradise","transliteration":"bil-janati","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":18,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":19,"ar":"تُوعَدُونَ","en_gloss":"promised","transliteration":"tūʿadūna","verse_key":"41:30"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٣٠","en_gloss":"(30)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:30"}]},{"verse_key":"41:31","surah":41,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"نَحْنُ أَوْلِيَآؤُكُمْ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَفِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ وَلَكُمْ فِيهَا مَا تَشْتَهِىٓ أَنفُسُكُمْ وَلَكُمْ فِيهَا مَا تَدَّعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We are your allies in this world and in the world to come, where you will have everything you desire and ask for","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"نَحْنُ","en_gloss":"We","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآؤُكُمْ","en_gloss":"(are) your protectors","transliteration":"awliyāukum","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَفِى","en_gloss":"and in","transliteration":"wafī","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"And for you","transliteration":"walakum","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَشْتَهِىٓ","en_gloss":"desire","transliteration":"tashtahī","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَنفُسُكُمْ","en_gloss":"your souls","transliteration":"anfusukum","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"and for you","transliteration":"walakum","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تَدَّعُونَ","en_gloss":"you ask","transliteration":"taddaʿūna","verse_key":"41:31"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:31"}]},{"verse_key":"41:32","surah":41,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"نُزُلًا مِّنْ غَفُورٍ رَّحِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"as a welcoming gift from the Most Forgiving, Most Merciful One.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"نُزُلًۭا","en_gloss":"A hospitable gift","transliteration":"nuzulan","verse_key":"41:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"41:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"غَفُورٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrin","verse_key":"41:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَّحِيمٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmin","verse_key":"41:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:32"}]},{"verse_key":"41:33","surah":41,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَنْ أَحْسَنُ قَوْلًا مِّمَّن دَعَآ إِلَى ٱللَّهِ وَعَمِلَ صَـٰلِحًا وَقَالَ إِنَّنِى مِنَ ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Who speaks better than someone who calls people to God, does what is right, and says, ‘I am one of those devoted to God’?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"And who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَحْسَنُ","en_gloss":"(is) better","transliteration":"aḥsanu","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَوْلًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) speech","transliteration":"qawlan","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّمَّن","en_gloss":"than (one) who","transliteration":"mimman","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"دَعَآ","en_gloss":"invites","transliteration":"daʿā","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَعَمِلَ","en_gloss":"and does","transliteration":"waʿamila","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","en_gloss":"righteous (deeds)","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"and says","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنَّنِى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I am","transliteration":"innanī","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"those who submit","transliteration":"l-mus'limīna","verse_key":"41:33"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:33"}]},{"verse_key":"41:34","surah":41,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَسْتَوِى ٱلْحَسَنَةُ وَلَا ٱلسَّيِّئَةُ ۚ ٱدْفَعْ بِٱلَّتِى هِىَ أَحْسَنُ فَإِذَا ٱلَّذِى بَيْنَكَ وَبَيْنَهُۥ عَدَٰوَةٌ كَأَنَّهُۥ وَلِىٌّ حَمِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Good and evil cannot be equal. [Prophet], repel evil with what is better and your enemy will become as close as an old and valued friend,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَسْتَوِى","en_gloss":"(are) equal","transliteration":"tastawī","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْحَسَنَةُ","en_gloss":"the good (deed)","transliteration":"l-ḥasanatu","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّيِّئَةُ ۚ","en_gloss":"the evil (deed)","transliteration":"l-sayi-atu","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱدْفَعْ","en_gloss":"Repel","transliteration":"id'faʿ","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"by (that) which","transliteration":"bi-allatī","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هِىَ","en_gloss":"[it]","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَحْسَنُ","en_gloss":"(is) better","transliteration":"aḥsanu","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"then behold","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"One who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَيْنَكَ","en_gloss":"between you","transliteration":"baynaka","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَبَيْنَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and between him","transliteration":"wabaynahu","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَدَٰوَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(was) enmity","transliteration":"ʿadāwatun","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَأَنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"(will become) as if he","transliteration":"ka-annahu","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلِىٌّ","en_gloss":"(was) a friend","transliteration":"waliyyun","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":17,"ar":"حَمِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"intimate","transliteration":"ḥamīmun","verse_key":"41:34"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:34"}]},{"verse_key":"41:35","surah":41,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا يُلَقَّىٰهَآ إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ صَبَرُوا۟ وَمَا يُلَقَّىٰهَآ إِلَّا ذُو حَظٍّ عَظِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but only those who are steadfast in patience, only those who are blessed with great righteousness, will attain to such goodness.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"41:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُلَقَّىٰهَآ","en_gloss":"it is granted","transliteration":"yulaqqāhā","verse_key":"41:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"41:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(to) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"41:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"صَبَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"(are) patient","transliteration":"ṣabarū","verse_key":"41:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"41:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُلَقَّىٰهَآ","en_gloss":"it is granted","transliteration":"yulaqqāhā","verse_key":"41:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"41:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ذُو","en_gloss":"(to the) owner","transliteration":"dhū","verse_key":"41:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَظٍّ","en_gloss":"(of) fortune","transliteration":"ḥaẓẓin","verse_key":"41:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَظِيمٍۢ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","verse_key":"41:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣٥","en_gloss":"(35)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:35"}]},{"verse_key":"41:36","surah":41,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِمَّا يَنزَغَنَّكَ مِنَ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ نَزْغٌ فَٱسْتَعِذْ بِٱللَّهِ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If a prompting from Satan should stir you, seek refuge with God: He is the All Hearing and the All Knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِمَّا","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-immā","verse_key":"41:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَنزَغَنَّكَ","en_gloss":"whisper comes to you","transliteration":"yanzaghannaka","verse_key":"41:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"41:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","verse_key":"41:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَزْغٌۭ","en_gloss":"an evil suggestion","transliteration":"nazghun","verse_key":"41:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَٱسْتَعِذْ","en_gloss":"then seek refuge","transliteration":"fa-is'taʿidh","verse_key":"41:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"41:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"41:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"[He]","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"41:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلسَّمِيعُ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Hearer","transliteration":"l-samīʿu","verse_key":"41:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_gloss":"the All-Knower","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","verse_key":"41:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣٦","en_gloss":"(36)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:36"}]},{"verse_key":"41:37","surah":41,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنْ ءَايَـٰتِهِ ٱلَّيْلُ وَٱلنَّهَارُ وَٱلشَّمْسُ وَٱلْقَمَرُ ۚ لَا تَسْجُدُوا۟ لِلشَّمْسِ وَلَا لِلْقَمَرِ وَٱسْجُدُوا۟ لِلَّهِ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَهُنَّ إِن كُنتُمْ إِيَّاهُ تَعْبُدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The night, the day, the sun, the moon, are only a few of His signs. Do not bow down in worship to the sun or the moon, but bow down to God who created them, if it is truly Him that you worship.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنْ","en_gloss":"And of","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِ","en_gloss":"His Signs","transliteration":"āyātihi","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلُ","en_gloss":"(are) the night","transliteration":"al-laylu","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلنَّهَارُ","en_gloss":"and the day","transliteration":"wal-nahāru","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلشَّمْسُ","en_gloss":"and the sun","transliteration":"wal-shamsu","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْقَمَرُ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the moon","transliteration":"wal-qamaru","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَسْجُدُوا۟","en_gloss":"prostrate","transliteration":"tasjudū","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِلشَّمْسِ","en_gloss":"to the sun","transliteration":"lilshamsi","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لِلْقَمَرِ","en_gloss":"to the moon","transliteration":"lil'qamari","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱسْجُدُوا۟","en_gloss":"but prostrate","transliteration":"wa-us'judū","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":15,"ar":"خَلَقَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"created them","transliteration":"khalaqahunna","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِيَّاهُ","en_gloss":"Him alone","transliteration":"iyyāhu","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":19,"ar":"تَعْبُدُونَ","en_gloss":"worship","transliteration":"taʿbudūna","verse_key":"41:37"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:37"}]},{"verse_key":"41:38","surah":41,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِنِ ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟ فَٱلَّذِينَ عِندَ رَبِّكَ يُسَبِّحُونَ لَهُۥ بِٱلَّيْلِ وَٱلنَّهَارِ وَهُمْ لَا يَسْـَٔمُونَ ۩","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If the disbelievers are too arrogant, [remember, Prophet, that] those who are with your Lord glorify Him tirelessly night and day.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِنِ","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"fa-ini","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they are arrogant","transliteration":"is'takbarū","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"then those who","transliteration":"fa-alladhīna","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"(are) near","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَبِّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُسَبِّحُونَ","en_gloss":"glorify","transliteration":"yusabbiḥūna","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱلَّيْلِ","en_gloss":"by night","transliteration":"bi-al-layli","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ","en_gloss":"and day","transliteration":"wal-nahāri","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"And they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَسْـَٔمُونَ ۩","en_gloss":"tire","transliteration":"yasamūna","verse_key":"41:38"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٣٨","en_gloss":"(38)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:38"}]}]}